# Framework overview

- Target: https://automationexercise.com (API under `/api/*`)
- Stack: Playwright + TypeScript, Chromium only
- Layout: `src/{api,config,factories,fixtures,locators,pages}` + `tests/{api,ui,flows}`

## Imports

```ts
import { test, expect } from '@fixtures';
import { buildUser } from '@factories/user.factory';
import type { LocatorConfig } from '@locators';
```

Aliases: `@api`, `@pages`, `@factories`, `@fixtures`, `@config`, `@locators`.

## Must follow

- Specs use fixtures for pages, `api`, and factories — no ad-hoc `new HomePage(page)`.
- Assert API `responseCode` in the JSON body (HTTP is often 200 even for 201/400/404).
- Unique emails per test; factory create/dispose.
- Locators: config strategy arrays for **fragile** controls only + page getters (`this.loc`); stable `#id` / `data-qa` stay as `this.page.locator(...)`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` before inventing a parallel structure.
